Linear Regression vs Logistic Regression
Linear Regression

Used when output is a number.


Hours Studied → Marks
House Size → Price
CPU Trend → Future CPU Usage


Example Output:


120 Marks
₹25 Lakh
75% CPU

Logistic Regression

Used when output is a category.

Pass / Fail
Spam / Not Spam
Server Fail / No Fail
Loan Approve / Reject

Example Output:

Plain Text
0 = No
1 = Yes













